sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User
    participant Web as GeoLens Web
    participant API as Nest API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Outbox as Outbox Publisher
    participant Queue as Job Queue
    participant Worker as Provider Worker
    participant Adapter as Provider Adapter
    participant Provider as Allowed AI Provider

    User->>Web: Add prompt and schedule
    Web->>API: POST monitoring plan
    API->>DB: Save plan + executions + outbox rows
    API-->>Web: 202 Accepted + runBatchId
    Outbox->>Queue: Publish execution jobs
    Queue->>Worker: Deliver execution
    Worker->>DB: Claim idempotently, create attempt
    Worker->>Adapter: Execute prompt with model/region
    Adapter->>Provider: Authorized request
    Provider-->>Adapter: Answer + provider metadata
    Adapter-->>Worker: Normalized result + raw payload
    Worker->>DB: Append raw response + attempt status
    Worker->>DB: Store extracted mentions/citations and parser version
    User->>Web: Open run details
    Web->>API: GET run batch / executions
    API->>DB: Read status, aggregates and evidence
    DB-->>API: Results + sample counts
    API-->>Web: Dashboard data / answer evidence
    Web-->>User: Update trend and evidence drawer

    Note over Worker,Queue: Retry transient errors with idempotency and bounded backoff
    Note over DB: Provider failure, not-triggered result, and no mention are separate states
